    "physicalNotes": [
      "Seat SN74HC32N pin 1 at F12. Leave unused outputs 6, 8 and 11 isolated. Tie all unused inputs to ground.",
      "Apply a referenced 0 V or 5 V input to each stimulus lead. Do not leave active inputs floating.",
      "Fit the LED cathode at B28. The 2.2 kΩ series resistor limits the ideal output estimate to about 1.36 mA.",
      "Place C1 between the VCC strip and common return."
    ],
